{number: 147}
{title: God be with You}
{key: Db}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[Db] God be with you till we [Gb] meet a-[Db] gain;
By His counsels guide, up-[Ab7] hold you,
With His [Db] sheep securely [Gb] fold you;
[Db] God be with you [Ab7] till we meet a-[Db] gain.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
Till we [Gb] meet, till we [Db] meet,
Till we meet at [Ab7] Jesus' feet;
Till we [Db] meet, till we [Gb] meet,
[Db] God be with you [Ab7] till we meet a-[Db] gain.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: 2}
[Db] God be with you till we [Gb] meet a-[Db] gain;
'Neath His wings securely [Ab7] hide you,
Daily [Db] manna still pro-[Gb] vide you;
[Db] God be with you [Ab7] till we meet a-[Db] gain.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 3}
[Db] God be with you till we [Gb] meet a-[Db] gain;
When life's perils thick con-[Ab7] found you,
Put un-[Db] failing arms a-[Gb] round you;
[Db] God be with you [Ab7] till we meet a-[Db] gain.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 4}
[Db] God be with you till we [Gb] meet a-[Db] gain;
Keep love's banner floating [Ab7] o'er you,
Smite death's [Db] threatening wave be-[Gb] fore you;
[Db] God be with you [Ab7] till we meet a-[Db] gain.
{end_of_verse}
